                "finding": "the exact-2x path launches grid (cdiv(IW,128), IH, N*C) = 16384 programs for timing-1; each program owns a single input row of 128 columns, issues 9 separately-masked row loads of 128 halfs and 2 interleaved 256-element stores, i.e. ~4 KB of traffic per program.",
